          "name": "Text",
          "fill": "$rt-text-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1480,
          "content": "Agents and Peers sign in with Credentials. Trunks use Credentials for registration and authentication. A Number belongs to a Trunk and its aorLink sends inbound calls to an Agent or a Peer's AOR. An ACL lists allowed and denied networks; today Connect enforces the Trunk ACL's allow list.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
