          "y": 730,
          "name": "Text",
          "fill": "$rt-text-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 450,
          "content": "MessageRequest carries the SIP message as protobuf plus routing metadata: ref (Call-ID), edgePortRef, method, sender, listeningPoints, externalAddrs and localnets.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "IcGTh",
          "x": 575,
          "y": 730,
          "name": "Text",
          "fill": "$rt-text-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 450,
          "content": "Processors and middlewares share one gRPC contract: ProcessMessage(MessageRequest) returns MessageResponse. Keep them stateless so you can run as many copies as you need.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "A6YRt",
          "x": 1090,
          "y": 730,
          "name": "Text",
          "fill": "$rt-text-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 450,
          "content": "An error response from the processor skips the post-processor middlewares. EdgePort keeps the SIP transaction and connection the whole time.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
