          "fill": "$rt-text-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 540,
          "content": "The Location Service stores which EdgePort each registration came through (edgePortRef). When the request is on a different EdgePort, the Connect processor adds a Route header to the peer EdgePort and an X-Edgeport-Ref header.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Z9cymZ",
          "x": 1000,
          "y": 820,
          "name": "Text",
          "fill": "$rt-text-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 540,
          "content": "List peer EdgePorts in TRUSTED_EDGEPORT_ADDRESSES so they accept X-Edgeport-Ref. No SIP load balancer is needed. If an EdgePort goes away, its clients re-register through another one.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
